    {
      "question": "What is the core problem you are solving? Why is this a big problem? What made you decide to work on it?",
      "answer": "Factories waste time quoting, sourcing, and cutting aluminum blocks. It's slow, manual, and adds unnecessary overhead. This inefficiency compounds across thousands of jobs, dragging down margins and throughput. We started Nox to automate this layer and unlock speed and scale for modern manufacturing."
    }
