      "id": 92971,
      "title": "NOX METALS: The modern metals supplier.",
      "tagline": "Modern metals factories to supply America's industrial base. ",
      "body": "**NOX METALS: The Factory is the Product**\\\nVertically integrated, automated metals factories built to move at software speed.\n\n**TL;DR:** Nox Metals is building the metals processing platform of the future. Our vertically integrated factories run on software and automation to deliver lightning-fast, low-cost metal to our customers. Our goal: power the next industrial era by becoming the fastest, most advanced supplier to America’s industrial base.\n\nLaunch Video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X6qMjj4RMBQ\n\n## 🛑 The Problem\n\nEvery part, from aerospace components to automotive tooling, starts with raw metal. But the supply chain that delivers it hasn’t changed in decades:\n\n* **3–5 days** to get a quote from a broker.\n* **Multiple markups** between the mill and your shop.\n* **Slow fulfillment** with no visibility once you order.\n* **High overhead** baked into every part because of manual, fragmented workflows.\n\nThis slows down factories, raises costs, and makes American manufacturing less competitive.\n\n## ⚡ The Nox Metals Model\n\nWe don’t just _use_ factories, we build them to be the product.\n\n* **Orders in → Machines moving:** Your quote instantly becomes a job on our automated cutting line.\n* **Software + Automation:** Robots pick, cut, package, and label… removing human bottlenecks.\n* **Lower Overhead:** No layers of brokers, reps, and schedulers.\n* **Faster for You:** Shorter lead times, real-time tracking, and predictable delivery.\n\nLower overhead means better prices. Faster cycle times mean more throughput for your factory.\n\n## 📈 Why It Works for Customers\n\n* **Time:** Place orders in minutes, get delivery in days.\n* **Cost:** Reduced overhead on our end means better pricing for you.\n* **Certainty:** Every order tracked from quote to delivery.\n\n## 🛠 Who We Serve\n\n* Job Shops\n* OEMs\n* Tier 1/2/3 Suppliers\n* Aerospace, Defense, and Industrial Manufacturers\n\n## 💬 Ask\n\nWe’re live with aluminum plate and block today, expanding into steel, tube, and sheet next. If you run a factory and need raw metal faster and cheaper, let’s talk.\n\n📩 zane@noxmetals.co\\\n🌐 [noxmetals.co](http://noxmetals.co)\n\nWhen your factory needs metal, ours is already working.",
      "url": "https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/OBX-nox-metals-the-modern-metals-supplier",
      "votes": 33,
      "created_at": "2025-08-13T19:15:21.779Z"
